    LLM: 'Avoid being trapped with high-number tiles; keep connectors that match multiple common end values.\n\nBecause the set is large, track which high values are scarce and avoid opening them without support.\n\nControl the open ends to force opponents into awkward values while maintaining your own safe exits across a wider value range.',
